invariant: INV-12
file: handshake_post.c
catches: unit
reason: the KeyUpdate reply is sealed with the receive direction's rec_dir, so one
  key and sequence counter now covers records travelling both ways

--- old
    if (rec_seal(&t->wr, REC_HANDSHAKE, msg, sizeof msg, t->tx, sizeof t->tx, &out_len) != 0 ||
--- new
    if (rec_seal(&t->rd, REC_HANDSHAKE, msg, sizeof msg, t->tx, sizeof t->tx, &out_len) != 0 ||
